          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in China–India trade and energy procurement directly raises tanker liftings from Persian Gulf exporters, physically increasing the barrels per day transiting regional chokepoints (e.g., Strait of Hormuz)." />
