          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained increase in China–India trade and investment creates larger integrated markets and revenue streams for China/India-based AI firms, forcing US-allied firms to accelerate productization and market rollouts to defend market share." />
