          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained higher oil prices raise the value of rents and sanction-leverage for Gulf producers and non-state actors, enabling greater funding and incentive to conduct maritime harassment or attacks on shipping to extract concessions or signal power, thereby increasing hostile incidents." />
