          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter financial conditions force firms to prioritize near-term revenue and cut discretionary spending, producing immediate reductions in budgets for internal safety teams, red‑teaming, audits, and rollout controls, lowering operational safety adoption." />
